{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/b22836bba356277738a083bf2dbc6d9c.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/b22836bba356277738a083bf2dbc6d9c.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/b22836bba356277738a083bf2dbc6d9c.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We Build Below</strong> is a roguelite factory building game for 1-3 players. Think automation game but in a roguelite formula with a deep dive into tower defense elements! The game focuses on strategic decision making, adaptability and risk &amp; reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/82c37396f2aad7b70f207e0997a0bf9c.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/82c37396f2aad7b70f207e0997a0bf9c.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/82c37396f2aad7b70f207e0997a0bf9c.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your character and preferred color. Each character will provide a unique perspective on how to play this game. Together with your friends you can make the perfect team for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/d3546875a1e723bd929ae6dad47ae428.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/d3546875a1e723bd929ae6dad47ae428.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/d3546875a1e723bd929ae6dad47ae428.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your factory deep underground on an alien planet with many unique biomes, each holding valuable, rare resources to mine. Your task is to collect, process and ship enough resources each day to meet the quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e3e2c590388fab679277d0d0687ab8ae.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e3e2c590388fab679277d0d0687ab8ae.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e3e2c590388fab679277d0d0687ab8ae.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defend your machines as they will produce a lot of nasty pollution that attracts dangerous parasites trying to eat your resources. You can defeat these parasites using your characters weapons &amp; tools or by placing turrets that will automatically defend your factory from the parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/0508ac113b77f2e3aed587c688f5ade1.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/0508ac113b77f2e3aed587c688f5ade1.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/0508ac113b77f2e3aed587c688f5ade1.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover lost treasure, upgrade your machines, and trade strategically. Each expedition is unique, with fresh ways to complete your orders.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929340?t=1772098127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/3754fc939f1e7ca931013511f9396a052c2edc88/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772098127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/bfa02cde1b4a61f46137352bbe29ffc93da3e203/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772098127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/bfa02cde1b4a61f46137352bbe29ffc93da3e203/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772098127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/b22836bba356277738a083bf2dbc6d9c.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/b22836bba356277738a083bf2dbc6d9c.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/b22836bba356277738a083bf2dbc6d9c.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We Build Below</strong> is a roguelite factory building game for 1-3 players. Think automation game but in a roguelite formula with a deep dive into tower defense elements! The game focuses on strategic decision making, adaptability and risk &amp; reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/82c37396f2aad7b70f207e0997a0bf9c.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/82c37396f2aad7b70f207e0997a0bf9c.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/82c37396f2aad7b70f207e0997a0bf9c.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your character and preferred color. Each character will provide a unique perspective on how to play this game. Together with your friends you can make the perfect team for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/d3546875a1e723bd929ae6dad47ae428.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/d3546875a1e723bd929ae6dad47ae428.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/d3546875a1e723bd929ae6dad47ae428.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your factory deep underground on an alien planet with many unique biomes, each holding valuable, rare resources to mine. Your task is to collect, process and ship enough resources each day to meet the quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e3e2c590388fab679277d0d0687ab8ae.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e3e2c590388fab679277d0d0687ab8ae.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/e3e2c590388fab679277d0d0687ab8ae.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defend your machines as they will produce a lot of nasty pollution that attracts dangerous parasites trying to eat your resources. You can defeat these parasites using your characters weapons &amp; tools or by placing turrets that will automatically defend your factory from the parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/0508ac113b77f2e3aed587c688f5ade1.poster.avif?t=1772098127\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/0508ac113b77f2e3aed587c688f5ade1.webm?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/extras/0508ac113b77f2e3aed587c688f5ade1.mp4?t=1772098127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover lost treasure, upgrade your machines, and trade strategically. Each expedition is unique, with fresh ways to complete your orders.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Everheart"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929340/835c1c03257c94ffb790367dfe1a7623b3beb1bc/header.jpg?t=1772098127","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929340/1168455734/91d9fa61060faefe85b0388ae395bcb1cecab6af/1770218737/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770220611","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929340/1168455734/91d9fa61060faefe85b0388ae395bcb1cecab6af/1770218737/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770220611","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929340/1168455734/91d9fa61060faefe85b0388ae395bcb1cecab6af/1770218737/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770220611","id":257279265,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https:/